  advisor --> FAFR002 : Review alerts for proactive client management.
  client --> CFR006 : Get notified when spending exceeds limits in specific categories.
  client --> CFR007 : Explore investment options that suit their risk profile.
  client --> CFR008 : Stay informed about market events affecting investments.
  client --> CFR009 : View consolidated financial info across accounts and products.
  client --> CFR010 : Control data sharing with advisors for privacy.

